---
// Section 01 / Philosophy — Daring Vision. Uncompromising Precision.
---

<section class="section-padding philosophy" id="philosophy" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border-stroke);">
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="grid-12 philosophy-header">
    <div class="philosophy-label-col">
      <h2 class="font-mono-data" style="color: var(--text-secondary); letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;" data-animate="fade-up">
        01 / PHILOSOPHY
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="philosophy-title-col">
      <h3 class="font-display-lg" style="color: var(--primary); max-width: 800px;" data-animate="fade-up" data-animate-delay="100">
        Built for Theni. Finished like a landmark.
      </h3>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Grid -->
  <div class="grid-12 philosophy-content">
    <!-- Image with Architecture Badge -->
    <div class="philosophy-image-col img-zoom" data-animate="slide-left">
      <img
        alt="AFRAH teak and stone residence in Theni district"
        class="philosophy-img"
        src="/images/homes/philosophy.jpg"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="philosophy-img-badge font-mono-data">
        <span>UTHAMAPALAYAM</span>
        <span>THENI DT.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text & Feature Cards -->
    <div class="philosophy-text-col" data-animate="slide-right">
      <p class="font-body-lg" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 32px;">
        We do not just pour concrete; we build family homes. AFRAH is a Theni-based construction house — teak, stone, jaali and light — delivering independent residences from Uthamapalayam to Chinnamanur.
      </p>

      <!-- Feature Card: Structural Innovation -->
      <div class="philosophy-feature" data-animate="fade-up" style="--stagger: 200ms;">
        <h4 class="font-headline-md-mobile" style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Turnkey Residences</h4>
        <p class="font-body-sm" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
          Plan, estimate, and build two-storey homes from foundation to handover — with a clear ledger at every stage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Card: Local Craft -->
      <div class="philosophy-feature" data-animate="fade-up" style="--stagger: 400ms;">
        <h4 class="font-headline-md-mobile" style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Elevation & Craft</h4>
        <p class="font-body-sm" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
          Teak cladding, stone cladding, jaali screens and night lighting designed for Tamil Nadu street facades.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Card: Site presence -->
      <div class="philosophy-feature" data-animate="fade-up" style="--stagger: 600ms;">
        <h4 class="font-headline-md-mobile" style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">On-Site in Theni</h4>
        <p class="font-body-sm" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
          Local teams across Uthamapalayam, Chinnamanur and Cumbum — present on site, not managing from another city.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy-header {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .philosophy-header {
      margin-bottom: 128px;
    }
  }

  .philosophy-label-col {
    grid-column: span 4;
  }

  .philosophy-title-col {
    grid-column: span 4;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .philosophy-label-col {
      grid-column: span 3;
    }
    .philosophy-title-col {
      grid-column: span 9;
    }
  }

  .philosophy-content {
    align-items: center;
  }

  .philosophy-image-col {
    grid-column: span 4;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--surface-container);
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: var(--surface-glass-shadow);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .philosophy-image-col {
      grid-column: span 7;
    }
  }

  .philosophy-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .philosophy-image-col:hover .philosophy-img {
    transform: scale(1.04);
  }

  .philosophy-img-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--surface-glass);
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-glass-border);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .philosophy-text-col {
    grid-column: span 4;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .philosophy-text-col {
      grid-column: 9 / span 4;
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }

  .philosophy-feature {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-stroke);
    padding-top: 20px;
    transition: border-color 0.4s ease;
  }
</style>
